al Due</td><td>The initial alignment period is ending and renewal action is required to continue services under the ACCESS Model.</td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;https://dsacms.github.io/cmmi-access-model/CodeSystem/ACCESSEventTypeCS&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;0.9.12&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;alignment-renewal&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Alignment Renewal Due&quot;}\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;https://dsacms.github.io/cmmi-access-model/CodeSystem/ACCESSEventTypeCS&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;0.9.12&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;alignment-renewal&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Alignment Renewal Due&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td></tr><tr><td><a name=\"x-https://dsacms.github.io/cmmi-access-model/CodeSystem/ACCESSEventTypeCS-baseline-reporting-window\"> </a><code>https://dsacms.github.io/cmmi-access-model/CodeSystem/ACCESSEventTypeCS</code></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"CodeSystem-ACCESSEventTypeCS.html#ACCESSEventTypeCS-baseline-reporting-window\">baseline-reporting-window</a></td><td>Baseline Reporting Due</td><td>The baseline data report is due soon. If baseline reporting is not received within 60 days of alignment, the patient will be unaligned.</td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;https://dsacms.github.io/cmmi-access-model/CodeSystem/ACCESSEventTypeCS&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;0.9.12&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;baseline-reporting-window&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Baseline Reporting Due&quot;}\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"&lt;coding&gt;