&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;eCKM&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Early Cardio-Kidney-Metabolic track&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td></tr><tr><td><a name=\"x-https://dsacms.github.io/cmmi-access-model/CodeSystem/ACCESSTrackCS-CKM\"> </a><code>https://dsacms.github.io/cmmi-access-model/CodeSystem/ACCESSTrackCS</code></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"CodeSystem-ACCESSTrackCS.html#ACCESSTrackCS-CKM\">CKM</a></td><td>Cardio-Kidney-Metabolic track</td><td>Cardio-kidney-metabolic conditions, including diabetes, chronic kidney disease (3a or 3b), and atherosclerotic cardiovascular disease, including heart disease.</td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;https://dsacms.github.io/cmmi-access-model/CodeSystem/ACCESSTrackCS&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;0.9.12&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;CKM&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Cardio-Kidney-Metabolic track&quot;}\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;https://dsacms.github.io/cmmi-access-model/CodeSystem/ACCESSTrackCS&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;0.9.12&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;CKM&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Cardio-Kidney-Metabolic track&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;\" title=\"Click to Copy as Coding\" class=\"btn-copy\"> </button></span></td></tr><tr><td><a name=\"x-https://dsacms.github.io/cmmi-access-model/CodeSystem/ACCESSTrackCS-MSK\"> </a><code>https://dsacms.github.io/cmmi-access-model/CodeSystem/ACCESSTrackCS</code></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"CodeSystem-ACCESSTrackCS.html#ACCESSTrackCS-MSK\">MSK</a></td><td>Musculoskeletal track</td><td>Musculoskeletal conditions, including chronic musculoskeletal pain.</td><td><span class=\"copy-text-inline\"><button data-clipboard-text=\"{&quo